OL,3,GNEWSAPupils served life lessons from   
OL,4,Apickleball-playing pensioners          
OL,6,FCareer advice and life lessons over a  
OL,7,Fgame of pickleball?                    
OL,9,FThat's what students are being served  
OL,10,Fup every week at a club for pensioners.
OL,11,FAnd the elders, who can certainly keep 
OL,12,Fup with them on the competitive front, 
OL,13,Fget to hear about their lives.         
OL,15,FThe pupils are studying for their      
OL,16,FA-levels at Breda Academy - which is   
OL,17,Fnear the large Belvoir estate on the   
OL,18,Foutskirts of south Belfast - and every 
OL,19,FFriday, a group of them head to the    
OL,20,Festate's pensioners club.              
