OL,3,GNEWSAPupils served life lessons from   
OL,4,Apickleball-playing pensioners          
OL,6,FAnna, 18, told BBC News NI that making 
OL,7,Flunch and playing games with the       
OL,8,Fpensioners was something she looked    
OL,9,Fforward to.                            
